Subject: Some thoughts about Gemini UX
Message-ID: <4B4C9ED9-3998-47CD-ABD0-F0A499729B86@gerwitz.com>
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit
