Subject: [announce] Website and FAQ changes
Message-ID: <C9L3VK8JFVJ8.1Z6QGCIG7UEZ5@stilgar>
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit
MIME-Version: 1.0
