From: Alan <gemini@bunburya.eu>
Date: Fri, 16 Apr 2021 17:59:15 +0100
Subject: [tech] tls user_canceled issue with Java server + Go client
Message-ID: <9d49d85b-5356-35b1-43bd-b8f5abc5a54d@bunburya.eu>
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit
