PS: Your blog doesn't need a comments section. People should quote, link, and comment on their own blogs instead of expecting you to provide them a soapbox.

PPS: If you want to use the Jekyll static site generator for building a website, you might be interested in the jekyll-oedipus-theme gem I'm working on for my own use. Code's available at https://github.com/matthewgraybosch/jekyll-oedipus-theme, but it's still rough/incomplete.
